"problems (difficulty, discrimination), objective knowledge (knowledge "
"acquisition and application), and behavior (guessing and slipping). "
"Experimental results show PSKT's advantages in prediction accuracy, "
"reasonable knowledge state assessment, and learning process explanation. "
"The code is available at https://github.com/Oia-10/PSKT."

